CM 40M DIPOLE WITH 4:1 GUANELLA BALUN (FT-140-43×2 STACKED)
CM Purpose: Demonstrate 4:1 impedance transformation and CM suppression
CM Antenna: Symmetric dipole, feedpoint impedance ~200Ω (tuned for 4:1 input)
CM Balun: 2× FT-140-43 stacked, 8 turns bifilar, #16 enameled wire
CM Expected: 200Ω→50Ω transformation, 20+ dB CM suppression
